,{"type":"text","text":"and pass the collector’s API key to the destination as an "},{"code":"Authorization: Bearer","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" header field."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The body is JSON: one object per record, with the record’s identifier (which a redelivered record","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keeps), the event’s name, its timestamp, whether it is redelivered, its properties and its context.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Properties are read from the event’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Encodable"},{"text":" form, which ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"text":" derives, through the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event’s schema in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan"},{"text":" the encoder is made with. The context holds the standard","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"context keys the record has values for, its session and sample rate, and its trace context. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"text":" value is written only while the record reveals it; once redacted, a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sensitive"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"property is left out, and an array’s element, or a value inside a type the plan can’t map, is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"null"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A record the encoder can’t write is left out and the rest of the batch is sent: one whose event and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"version the plan doesn’t describe, one whose event isn’t ","type":"text"},{"code":"Encodable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and one holding a value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"JSON can’t, such as a NaN. Each is logged; ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/batch(of:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" returns the body","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with each record left out as a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/SkippedRecord","type":"reference"},{"text":". When no record of a batch can be written,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/CollectorEncoding\/documentation\/CollectorEncoding\/CollectorBatchEncoder\/encode(_:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" throws, and the destination sends nothing.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To send to a server of your own format, write a ","type":"text"},{"code":"BatchEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of your own. To send to PostHog,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use ","type":"text"},{"code":"PostHogBatchEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (module ","type":"text"},{"code":"PostHogEncoding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import CollectorEncoding","import HTTPDestinations","import TrackingPlans","","let plan = try TrackingPlan(schemas: [SignedUp.schema])","let encoder = CollectorBatchEncoder(plan: plan)","let collector = HTTPDestination(","    endpoint: collectorURL,  \/\/ https:\/\/collector.example.com\/v1\/batches","    headerFields: [.authorization: \"Bearer \\(apiKey)\"],","    encoder: encoder)","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: collector)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers sending to the collector beside the other destinations."}]}]}],"references":{"do